{"lrc":"[00:54.30]使我敬畏\n[00:59.30]使我心得安慰\n[01:31.66]许多危险，试\n[01:41.88]我已安然经\n[02:21.22]恩光爱谊千年","canonical":["奇异恩典，何等甘甜，我罪已得赦免；","前我失丧，今得寻回，瞎眼今得看见。","如此恩典，使我敬畏，使我心得安慰；","初信之时，我蒙恩惠，真是何等宝贵。","许多危险，试炼网罗，我已安然经过；","靠主恩典，安全不怕，更引导我归家。","将来禧年，圣徒欢聚，恩光爱谊千年；","喜乐颂赞，在父座前，深望那日快现。"],"syncSegments":[{"time":0,"end":11.2,"text":""},{"time":11.2,"end":11.98,"text":""},{"time":12.6,"end":21.78,"text":""},{"time":24.68,"end":30.34,"text":""},{"time":30.34,"end":36.06,"text":""},{"time":36.06,"end":45.12,"text":""},{"time":50,"end":53.72,"text":""},{"time":54.3,"end":59.3,"text":"使我敬畏"},{"time":59.3,"end":67.34,"text":"使我心得安慰"},{"time":69.46,"end":77.72,"text":""},{"time":77.72,"end":80.08,"text":""},{"time":80.08,"end":88.84,"text":""},{"time":91.66,"end":98.14,"text":"许多危险，试"},{"time":98.14,"end":101.88,"text":""},{"time":101.88,"end":108.3,"text":"我已安然经"},{"time":108.3,"end":109.52,"text":""},{"time":112.02,"end":118.92,"text":""},{"time":118.92,"end":121.8,"text":""},{"time":121.8,"end":129.42,"text":""},{"time":132.12,"end":138.3,"text":""},{"time":138.3,"end":141.22,"text":""},{"time":141.22,"end":148.78,"text":"恩光爱谊千年"},{"time":150.88,"end":157.88,"text":""},{"time":157.88,"end":159.74,"text":""},{"time":163.14,"end":172,"text":""},{"time":174.52,"end":176.28,"text":""},{"time":176.28,"end":178,"text":""},{"time":178.9,"end":181.86,"text":""}],"reviewNeeded":true,"syncCoverage":0.17857142857142858,"revision":"2026-11-09.3","timingRevision":"audio-v2","audioDuration":196.075102}